From: Christian Martinez <xtian437@gmail.com>
Subject: nat46: export a device's rules for hardware offload

An offload engine that translates in hardware has to be given the same rules
the device translates with. Export a copy of them, taken under the instance
reference, and nothing that hands out the live instance.

Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5-5
Signed-off-by: Christian Martinez <xtian437@gmail.com>
---
diff --git a/nat46/modules/nat46-core.h b/nat46/modules/nat46-core.h
